cto3vva298w	cto3vva298w	{"parentId":"qsk54ok1549","subKey":"items","subType":"array","use":"JSBlockModel","props":{},"decoratorProps":{"title":"Thống kê gợi ý câu hỏi"},"stepParams":{"jsSettings":{"runJs":{"version":"v2","code":"const { Alert, Card, Col, Row, Statistic } = ctx.libs.antd;\\nconst { BulbOutlined, CheckCircleOutlined, EditOutlined, StopOutlined } = ctx.libs.antdIcons;\\ntry {\\n  ctx.initResource('MultiRecordResource');\\n  ctx.resource.setResourceName('goi_y_cau_hoi');\\n  await ctx.resource.refresh();\\n  const rows = (ctx.resource.getData?.() || []).filter((r) => r.is_deleted !== true);\\n  const metrics = [\\n    { title: ctx.t('Tổng câu hỏi'), value: rows.length, color: '#1677ff', icon: <BulbOutlined /> },\\n    { title: ctx.t('Mới gợi ý'), value: rows.filter((r) => !r.trang_thai_ra_soat || r.trang_thai_ra_soat === 'moi_goi_y').length, color: '#d48806', icon: <BulbOutlined /> },\\n    { title: ctx.t('Đã chọn'), value: rows.filter((r) => r.trang_thai_ra_soat === 'da_chon').length, color: '#389e0d', icon: <CheckCircleOutlined /> },\\n    { title: ctx.t('Đã chỉnh sửa'), value: rows.filter((r) => r.trang_thai_ra_soat === 'da_chinh_sua').length, color: '#0958d9', icon: <EditOutlined /> },\\n  ];\\n  ctx.render(\\n    <Row gutter={[12, 12]}>\\n      {metrics.map((m) => (\\n        <Col key={m.title} xs={24} sm={12} xl={6}>\\n          <Card size=\\"small\\" bordered>\\n            <Statistic title={m.title} value={m.value} prefix={m.icon} valueStyle={{ color: m.color }} />\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n      ))}\\n    </Row>,\\n  );\\n} catch (error) {\\n  ctx.render(<Alert showIcon type=\\"error\\" message={ctx.t('Error')} description={String(error?.message || error)} />);\\n}"}},"__flowSurfaceMeta":{"declaredKey":"tab_goi_y.statsExamBlock"}}}
